# LF in the repository, always, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true stores CRLF in files
# that tooling then rejects: prettier and eslint report every line of an
# otherwise untouched file as an error, which buries the real diff. This is not
# hypothetical - it happened in the platform repo and produced 721 phantom lint
# errors in a single afternoon.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
